{"2831240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nocturnal Sun", "steam_appid": 2831240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lush environment and a mysterious culture envelop the realm of Nocturnal Sun. You're a humble researcher tasked with exploring the region and documenting your findings in a Codex. Capture the beauty and wonder of Cozamal to expand the Empire's knowledge of local resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience the open world RPG through exploration, encounters with characters, cultivating the land, fishing, hunting, and harvesting natural resources. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lush environment and a mysterious culture envelop the realm of Nocturnal Sun. You're a humble researcher tasked with exploring the region and documenting your findings in a Codex. Capture the beauty and wonder of Cozamal to expand the Empire's knowledge of local resources.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Experience the open world RPG through exploration, encounters with characters, cultivating the land, fishing, hunting, and harvesting natural resources. </p>", "short_description": "Nocturnal Sun is an open-world RPG set in the mysterious and lush environment of Cozamal. You've been tasked with exploring the region and documenting available resources within the Codex provided. Cultivate the land, fish, hunt, and harvest natural resources to discover the riches of Cozamal.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831240/e41088eab7aad74b1c4b03c52157ca95fa4259a2/header.jpg?t=1759798722", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2831240/89c9f03a06d69aebd6f7cee5038908075716e3dd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759798722", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app